Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.18,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,200,4000,4800)\pos(640,341.123)}Episode 39
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.18,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,220,4000,4800)\pos(635.932,531.235)}Burning of Chìbì
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:05.18,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:42.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(372.881,474.545)\}Zhōu Yú \NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Cai He!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:45.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Bring Cai He!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an injustice! An injustice! I have done no wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,An injustice! I have done no wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an injustice! I have done no wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.42,0:00:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.94,0:01:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretending to submit to us, don't try to deceive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him away and offer his head as sacrifice before the banner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:09.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(802.712,392.728)\\fade(255,0,255,0,300,1600,2140)}Cài Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kan Ze and Gan Ning also conspired with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.50,0:01:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That was to my design.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Execute him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships, forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We sail to Chibi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I leave this in your hands, Elder General Huang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.78,0:01:47.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(339.2,495.709)}Huáng Gài \NStyled: Gōngfù
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:02:00.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427.119,426.818)\}Zhōu Tài \NStyled: Yòupíng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:03.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(447.458,435)\}Hán Dāng \NStyled: Yìgōng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.78,0:02:06.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(332.203,495)\}Jiǎng Qīn \NStyled: Gōngyì
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.58,0:02:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.98,0:02:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:03:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready. Just wait for Huang Gai's news.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, there is a group of boats approaching upstream from the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The boats fly the blue dragon banner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"Vanguard Huang Gai" is written on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:13.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962.712,489.546)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,4180,4540)}Cáo Cāo \NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.10,0:03:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Gongfu is a man of his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven is aiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:24.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(974.072,489.546)}Chéng Yù \NStyled: Zhòngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mao Jie, Yu Jin, open the camp and welcome them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.30,0:03:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576}These boats are feigning \Ndefection, don't let them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576\pos(640,670.666)}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576}Chancellor, Huang Gai's letter said he would surrender some supply boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576}If these boats held cargo, they would sail steady and sit low in the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576\pos(640,670.666)}but these ships are light, and float easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.78,0:03:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576\pos(640,670.666)}Moreover, tonight the southeast wind is most fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576\pos(640,670.666)}If they deceived us, and used a fire attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.02,0:04:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576\pos(640,670.666)}how could we stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.62,0:04:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly! Stop those boats at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.78,0:04:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.14,0:04:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.74,0:04:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All boats, prepare to light the fires.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.74,0:04:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:36.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338.983,463.637)\}Wén Pìn \NStyled: Zhòngyè
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose the arrows! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Light the flames! Light the flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:50.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Light the fires!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.38,0:04:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop those boats at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the fire boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the fire boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.10,0:05:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, go forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass down my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou Tai, Chen Wu, Han Dang, Jiang Qing, \Nlight the flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:34.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Light the flames! Light the flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:35.80,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Light the flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:37.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Release!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge! Light the flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.98,0:06:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep calm! Keep calm! Don't panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the fire boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, put out the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:07:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There is fire all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your horse, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao, you bastard! Don't run! Huang Gai is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.78,0:08:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chancellor! Let us run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster, advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears to be Elder General Huang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us assist him at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.74,0:08:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang! Quickly, take him inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow along the northern bank and catch that traitor Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, move faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:10:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenyuan, what path can we take?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, there's only Wulin, where the path is broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. To Wulin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run, you traitor! Lü Meng is here! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.38,0:11:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao, don't leave! Ling Tong is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not, Chancellor. Xu Huang has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance, Chancellor. I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:33.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338.983,395.455)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,4180,4540)}Zhāng Liáo \NStyled: Wényuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.98,0:12:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:47.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338.983,497.727)\}Xú Huǎng \NStyled: Gōngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.18,0:12:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, it's Zhang He.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What path is ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The right path leads to Hefei, the left to Yiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:13:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,On the path to Hefei, Sun Quan and Lu Xun were there to intercept us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They've already dealt us many casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'd better follow the path to Yiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! There are troops pursuing us at our rear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Taishi Ci and Gan Ning are pursuing us from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.58,0:13:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Zhang He, cover the rear. The rest, just advance forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.22,0:14:09.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,4180,4540)\pos(973.921,375)}Zhāng Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Taishi Ci and Gan Ning have retreated. Both sides suffered casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, were it not for you generals fighting so fiercely,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have lost my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, this is the west of Wulin and the north of Yibei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am laughing at no one other than Zhou Yu for being so foolish, and Zhuge Liang being so unwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.22,0:15:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Were it me leading the troops, \NI would deploy troops in ambush here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What would become of me then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:47.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(359.322,495)\}Zhào Yún \NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not run away, traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Zhao Yun, have been waiting here for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.34,0:16:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ahead we can shelter ourselves in the woods and rest awhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! They're catching up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to panic. It's Tactician Cheng Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.62,0:17:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! Tactician Cheng Yu has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies for startling you, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies for startling you, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.74,0:17:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You have all exerted yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, what happened last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory and defeat are common affairs in war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Though my armies have suffered a setback,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.26,0:18:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have the North to rely on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have hundreds of thousands of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We will wait and reorganize ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.58,0:18:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and in the future we will be victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you bring some cooking utensils and some grain?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I must inform you, Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.50,0:18:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we have the cauldrons but no provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, our soldiers are hungry and cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.70,0:18:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We could kill some horses to feed ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:19:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. Prepare the cauldrons and cook some horse meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.22,0:19:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Right ahead. What road is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, one is the northern Yiling mountain path.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The other is the southern Yiling great road. Both lead to Jiangling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Which path is closer to Nanxi, Jiangling?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.06,0:19:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The southern Yiling road, passing through Hulukou.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Let's go this way, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Order the units to move at once. At Jiangling, we will look for grain to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:19:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the army has marched the entire night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They can barely stand. We'd better rest here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Chancellor. Have a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.34,0:21:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Gentlemen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us all eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the pursuing enemy is not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.94,0:21:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't remain here for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.74,0:21:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You are right. Get on the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.98,0:21:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.14,0:21:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.30,0:21:54.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(666.517,588)}"Hulukou"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.54,0:22:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you were laughing at Zhou Yu and Zhuge Liang,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but instead Zhao Yun came and killed many of our troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.74,0:22:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you laugh again now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I laugh because, after all, Zhou Yu and Zhuge Liang's guile is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If they placed a group of men in ambush here in Hulukou,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.50,0:23:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,leisurely waited for an exhausted enemy, violently burst out and surrounded my troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.06,0:23:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,then they would all be overwhelmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be hard to avoid disastrous casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.98,0:23:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Zhang Fei of Yan! Don't even think of running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.66,0:23:41.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(322.712,497.727)\}Zhāng Fēi \NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.74,0:23:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor Cao! Won't you get off your horse and accept your death?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.50,0:24:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, which path do we follow?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.54,0:25:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two paths ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.50,0:25:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please tell us the path to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.26,0:25:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Which path is closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.22,0:25:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The wider path is level, but is further by more than fifty {\i1}li.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.10,0:25:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The narrower path leads to Huarong road, but it is fifty {\i1}li{\i0} closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.58,0:25:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It is narrow, rough and hard to traverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.66,0:25:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go scout out up on the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.26,0:25:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.90,0:25:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep in the narrower path there are some smoke columns.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.90,0:25:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The wider path is quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.66,0:25:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the narrow road to Huarong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.98,0:25:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, where smoke rises there must be an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.62,0:25:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why follow the narrower path?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.06,0:25:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That is right, Chancellor. \NWhy follow the narrow path?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.74,0:25:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you not heard the military books mention,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.54,0:26:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"turn what is real into falsehood, and what is falsehood into reality"?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.10,0:26:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang has many schemes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.74,0:26:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He purposefully sent men to raise smoke on the narrow mountain path,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.34,0:26:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,causing us to be afraid of following that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.22,0:26:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, he has placed an ambush on the wider path.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.42,0:26:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame I have seen through his scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.14,0:26:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A most ingenious assessment, Chancellor! None can compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.22,0:26:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's march.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.30,0:26:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Let's march!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.38,0:27:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you stopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.50,0:27:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, these pits are full of water and the horses' hooves get stuck in the mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.70,0:27:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.62,0:27:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, advance! Be it mountains or rivers, we will open up a path through them!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.78,0:27:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How can't you get past a bit of mud?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.54,0:27:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut down the trees and pave the road with wood, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.92,0:27:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Any who lag behind will be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.06,0:27:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.06,0:27:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.14,0:27:55.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Move, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.66,0:27:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No wailing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.48,0:28:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Life and death are absolute. \NVictory or defeat depends on Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.18,0:28:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever weeps shall be immediately executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.14,0:28:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Move, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.26,0:28:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.34,0:28:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The men and the horses are exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.34,0:28:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, can't we rest a bit before moving on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.74,0:28:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.98,0:29:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We do not know what is ahead, and behind us the enemy is in pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.50,0:29:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot waver now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.66,0:29:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and we'll be resting in the next town before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.98,0:29:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.34,0:29:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.34,0:29:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.38,0:29:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We march.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.42,0:30:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They say Zhuge Liang has miraculous foresight and Zhou Yu's talents are extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.18,0:30:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But the way I see it, they are just incompetent fellows.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.26,0:30:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My troops are exhausted and their strength is depleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.86,0:30:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Had they placed an ambush here,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.50,0:31:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we would all be helplessly trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.82,0:31:25.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328.136,465)\}Guān Yǔ \NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.18,0:32:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the situation is desperate, we may fight to our utmost.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.70,0:32:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576}Chancellor, even if the men can continue, the horses are exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.26,0:32:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576\pos(640,670.666)}How can we fight anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.26,0:32:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576}Chancellor, Yunchang derides those above, \Nand is kind to those below.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.90,0:32:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576\pos(640,670.666)}He defies the strong and defends the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.18,0:32:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576\pos(640,670.666)}He weighs all favors and grievances honorably.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.02,0:32:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576\}In the past you have treated him kindly, Chancellor. {\bord13.576}You can implore him personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.10,0:32:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.576\pos(640,670.666)}and thus we may be spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.38,0:32:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this is how it is, \Nwe have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.30,0:33:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,General, have you been well since we last met?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.38,0:33:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Guan Yu, am following the Strategos' orders. \NI have been waiting a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.22,0:33:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeated and imperiled, I am now at a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.30,0:33:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope, General, you value \Nour friendship from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.10,0:33:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You are correct. In the past, \Nyou treated me most generously.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.18,0:33:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But for you I slayed Yan Liang \Nand cut down Wen Chou,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.46,0:33:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and I broke the siege of Baima. \NI have already repaid your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.46,0:33:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We are enemies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.34,0:33:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I let my lord down over my personal feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.46,0:34:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang, do you remember when you killed my generals to cross the five gates?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.34,0:34:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did I not send men in pursuit,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.62,0:34:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but I even sent three messengers \Nwith orders to let you pass, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.70,0:34:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A real man values honor and justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.86,0:34:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the morals of Spring and Autumn so well,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.06,0:34:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,can you really bear to kill an old friend now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.34,0:34:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you will not spare me, General...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.14,0:34:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I will dismount and accept my captivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.58,0:34:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I only hope, General,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.62,0:35:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,that you let the men under my command go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.86,0:35:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.10,0:35:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They have followed me for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.30,0:35:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.18,0:35:30.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(311.864,456.818)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,4180,4540)}Zhāng Liáo \NStyled: Wényuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.86,0:35:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.42,0:35:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-General Guan... \N-Yunchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.70,0:35:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.98,0:36:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.54,0:36:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! You made a military pledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.78,0:36:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop there!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.58,0:36:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Yunchang!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.10,0:37:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Cao Cao has escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.26,0:37:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.94,0:38:43.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(972.837,497.727)}Liú Bèi \NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.78,0:38:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink! Drink to your heart's content!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.86,0:38:46.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(323.797,509.031)}Zhūgé Liàng \NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.46,0:38:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink a few more cups!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.74,0:38:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, Third Brother, you have rendered great services in this battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.30,0:38:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When Second Brother arrives, we will all have our fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.26,0:38:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide, drink as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.90,0:39:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.50,0:39:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.50,0:39:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, how about we drink together?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.02,0:39:14.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,On the winter of the 23rd year of the Jian'an era (208 CE),
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.26,0:39:19.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan and Liu Bei allied to oppose Cao Cao, \Nand defeated his 830,000 men,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.14,0:39:23.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,achieving a glorious victory at the battle of Chibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.10,0:39:27.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao's fleeing army encountered Guan Yu at Huarong road.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.78,0:39:30.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao appealed to their former friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.54,0:39:35.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and in the end moved Guan Yu to spare his life, allowing him to flee to Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.38,0:39:41.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,However, Guan Yu had made a military pledge to Zhuge Liang,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.30,0:39:47.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and now faces the severe punishment of military law.

